  "title": "Changing Enemy Collapse Effects [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "敵消滅時の演出を変更する【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "eef6eaf8b8bd039bb6e26a3837318192bbe39b6f56b7caedb0ea6d0d3aba084c",
      "translation": "Changing Enemy Collapse Effects [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "eef6eaf8b8bd039bb6e26a3837318192bbe39b6f56b7caedb0ea6d0d3aba084c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵が消滅する際のエフェクトを変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "f04f7bb257b6b00a1f78c2bd1d59280ed9c714b396f104c61570a5bda6c98fb6",
      "translation": "Changes the effect displayed when an enemy collapses.",
      "contextHash": "f04f7bb257b6b00a1f78c2bd1d59280ed9c714b396f104c61570a5bda6c98fb6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上の動画では、雑魚敵をボスと同じように沈む演出にしています。",
      "sourceHash": "7d86eaeac20a944626f306cf94db0020ac667153398318af7ac56e8650021c29",
      "translation": "In the video above, the normal enemies are made to sink in the same way as the boss.",
      "contextHash": "7d86eaeac20a944626f306cf94db0020ac667153398318af7ac56e8650021c29"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
