    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2023/10/29 -> 2025/06/07（ver1.00 -> 1.002）",
      "sourceHash": "08dac52b80e68a0a170c3e0510467ec108745a296455c1608d0aa7599f6ce7bb",
      "translation": "2023/10/29 -> 2025/06/07 (ver1.00 -> 1.002) ",
      "contextHash": "08dac52b80e68a0a170c3e0510467ec108745a296455c1608d0aa7599f6ce7bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "消滅時間が整数以外だと『効果音２』と『揺れの強さ』が有効にならない不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "848f63a787b4acedc09ee53dc960e13e0378dcabb4db71c5bb3c8ac0b3fb08bb",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where 『Sound Effect 2』 and 『Shake Strength』 were not enabled when the collapse duration was not an integer.",
      "contextHash": "848f63a787b4acedc09ee53dc960e13e0378dcabb4db71c5bb3c8ac0b3fb08bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "（2024/2/28 ver1.001）",
      "sourceHash": "3aa51594a2040294a06a0de983829c8645249267092a759fa6e6f569ba64ab9a",
      "translation": " (2024/2/28 ver1.001) ",
      "contextHash": "3aa51594a2040294a06a0de983829c8645249267092a759fa6e6f569ba64ab9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "不要な処理（Game_Battler.prototype.performCollapse）が常時呼ばれてしまう不具合修正。（2025/06/07 ver1.002）",
      "sourceHash": "bfb73f6b39d48e1c520eafff9b5a1d3fcd53658f0caa24cb4950867f3c4e6043",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where unnecessary processing (Game_Battler.prototype.performCollapse) was always called. (2025/06/07 ver1.002)",
      "contextHash": "bfb73f6b39d48e1c520eafff9b5a1d3fcd53658f0caa24cb4950867f3c4e6043"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "※通常は空の処理ですが、他のプラグインとの兼ね合いによっては問題になる可能性があります。",
      "sourceHash": "7af696a09a91d1877beb33767858002600ce93e171cd4e487247825319fe7b6f",
      "translation": "※This normally performs no processing, but it may cause problems depending on how it interacts with other plugins.",
      "contextHash": "7af696a09a91d1877beb33767858002600ce93e171cd4e487247825319fe7b6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "How to Use (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクト一覧に設定を登録してください。",
      "sourceHash": "3152284dd21032c7bb6f1c849047bdda947e3febf923c68cbe215be8b0d9a969",
      "translation": "Register settings in the Collapse Effect List.",
      "contextHash": "3152284dd21032c7bb6f1c849047bdda947e3febf923c68cbe215be8b0d9a969"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ここで登録したＩＤによって紐づけを行います。",
      "sourceHash": "2992d1120253ade2f1bc489ede2ed63db04b86def14c273f17e9bc1b3e87ae66",
      "translation": "The ID registered here is used to associate the effect.",
      "contextHash": "2992d1120253ade2f1bc489ede2ed63db04b86def14c273f17e9bc1b3e87ae66"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクトはプラグインパラメータによって、全体に適用することができる他、敵毎に個別に指定することもできます。",
      "sourceHash": "0ab974c51043326c2ad45da336b3bac55fe1b22608b18f21a131be5e5694398f",
      "translation": "Collapse effects can be applied globally using plugin parameters, or specified individually for each enemy.",
      "contextHash": "0ab974c51043326c2ad45da336b3bac55fe1b22608b18f21a131be5e5694398f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "敵キャラのメモ欄（Note of Enemies）",
      "sourceHash": "b274f85ded5086cc11d9797be5f401d2a3af33520b62b538f77b6629febda530",
      "translation": "Enemy Note Field (Note of Enemies)",
      "contextHash": "b274f85ded5086cc11d9797be5f401d2a3af33520b62b538f77b6629febda530"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "消滅方法の指定",
      "sourceHash": "a7a01b504696884eb4f7e79a512eafe2e54f3d886fbba8337df11f49612b9650",
      "translation": "Specifying the Collapse Method",
      "contextHash": "a7a01b504696884eb4f7e79a512eafe2e54f3d886fbba8337df11f49612b9650"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "登録した消滅エフェクトを、ＩＤによって敵と紐づけします。",
      "sourceHash": "cb85e57d18e9534fa3e71e554f33ecabb5d7137d7a3ba63ea751b2b1f3e7c5e3",
      "translation": "Associate a registered collapse effect with an enemy using its ID.",
      "contextHash": "cb85e57d18e9534fa3e71e554f33ecabb5d7137d7a3ba63ea751b2b1f3e7c5e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※[]は含まないでください。",
      "sourceHash": "098fbacab2c449d8df642ed33a21ef9c75c036f0a10bf9dfdbe20faf7f7b5522",
      "translation": "※Do not include [].",
      "contextHash": "098fbacab2c449d8df642ed33a21ef9c75c036f0a10bf9dfdbe20faf7f7b5522"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "サンプル（Sample）",
      "sourceHash": "076bbe45f0928d9434f0482f38c763ad52439ee605e700f95ee77ad3570a3f10",
      "translation": "Sample (Sample)",
      "contextHash": "076bbe45f0928d9434f0482f38c763ad52439ee605e700f95ee77ad3570a3f10"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクト一覧に以下のサンプルを用意しています。",
      "sourceHash": "9ddc81f66cae4a255a5e94c465002bf9292dcc049215f653a0f252353eef6bf1",
      "translation": "The following samples are provided in the Collapse Effect List.",
      "contextHash": "9ddc81f66cae4a255a5e94c465002bf9292dcc049215f653a0f252353eef6bf1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常の敵消滅演出と全く同じものです。",
      "sourceHash": "7cad27d280597f788cd358b8c965c0e5de251e9cc523358bb19bb54f99ab8712",
      "translation": "This is exactly the same as the normal enemy collapse effect.",
      "contextHash": "7cad27d280597f788cd358b8c965c0e5de251e9cc523358bb19bb54f99ab8712"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "参考用にご利用ください。",
      "sourceHash": "f8011f3e4711548ab760b1b6ea21e6f7513c65786504ac74213054f37b6a820e",
      "translation": "Please use it for reference.",
      "contextHash": "f8011f3e4711548ab760b1b6ea21e6f7513c65786504ac74213054f37b6a820e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常のボス消滅演出と全く同じものです。",
      "sourceHash": "7a1627af6c40950ca47009cc69dd957f5caaa01a200b95334f450332ff1a2ec1",
      "translation": "This is exactly the same as the normal boss collapse effect.",
      "contextHash": "7a1627af6c40950ca47009cc69dd957f5caaa01a200b95334f450332ff1a2ec1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵が沈むように消滅します。",
      "sourceHash": "9c4f0964ede2e9d34505ef866fa1e150beb8e1da76c42987003710e0698178b9",
      "translation": "The enemy collapses as if sinking.",
      "contextHash": "9c4f0964ede2e9d34505ef866fa1e150beb8e1da76c42987003710e0698178b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ボス消滅演出に画面振動を加えたものです。",
      "sourceHash": "3c0d3ed61cc3a4c1613feedbfbb9f8247281045e275873481c794837cbe5e4da",
      "translation": "This adds screen shaking to the boss collapse effect.",
      "contextHash": "3c0d3ed61cc3a4c1613feedbfbb9f8247281045e275873481c794837cbe5e4da"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "消滅エフェクト一覧（CollapseList）",
      "sourceHash": "51797258ffb3eb82c290187584048eeed7a2d078f2aedde6879a97a87c817350",
      "translation": "Collapse Effect List (CollapseList)",
      "contextHash": "51797258ffb3eb82c290187584048eeed7a2d078f2aedde6879a97a87c817350"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクトを定義する一覧です。",
      "sourceHash": "5962b54e12104d797201201bed3b28f534ea4bd7a10c96bfe78e915e963472c3",
      "translation": "This is a list for defining collapse effects.",
      "contextHash": "5962b54e12104d797201201bed3b28f534ea4bd7a10c96bfe78e915e963472c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "標準の消滅ＩＤ（DefaultCollapseId）",
      "sourceHash": "488b9fcc85e3a4cd20fb39d1bd241593b69ae5efae7d1a7aaa9f144cab03c047",
      "translation": "Default Collapse ID (DefaultCollapseId)",
      "contextHash": "488b9fcc85e3a4cd20fb39d1bd241593b69ae5efae7d1a7aaa9f144cab03c047"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "標準の消滅エフェクトです。",
      "sourceHash": "37f3649840a0ab2ce94667a5ecf3121fc5c44934de07e769779dca8fb495f057",
      "translation": "This is the default collapse effect.",
      "contextHash": "37f3649840a0ab2ce94667a5ecf3121fc5c44934de07e769779dca8fb495f057"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクト一覧のＩＤを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "8c8e66062801c8cd24e895793ff9abaaf4b64fa3a087436d4527044840d35e2f",
      "translation": "Specify the ID from the Collapse Effect List.",
      "contextHash": "8c8e66062801c8cd24e895793ff9abaaf4b64fa3a087436d4527044840d35e2f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "標準の消滅ＩＤ（ボス）（DefaultBossCollapseId）",
      "sourceHash": "2f59f1bc7061e8e08ed2c880f1ae9c46f4509e49f42ed2000d04ca42360995f6",
      "translation": "Default Boss Collapse ID (DefaultBossCollapseId)",
      "contextHash": "2f59f1bc7061e8e08ed2c880f1ae9c46f4509e49f42ed2000d04ca42360995f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "標準のボスの消滅エフェクトです。",
      "sourceHash": "8999a895862efc57cf8a34e6423ae92557c95ef4ff18ee3c5940f1860720b509",
      "translation": "This is the default boss collapse effect.",
      "contextHash": "8999a895862efc57cf8a34e6423ae92557c95ef4ff18ee3c5940f1860720b509"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクト一覧のＩＤを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "8c8e66062801c8cd24e895793ff9abaaf4b64fa3a087436d4527044840d35e2f",
      "translation": "Specify the ID from the Collapse Effect List.",
      "contextHash": "8c8e66062801c8cd24e895793ff9abaaf4b64fa3a087436d4527044840d35e2f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（消滅）（Plugin Parameters Collapse）",
      "sourceHash": "7e5594f2ad7af33794caf6a359f3c6673471cc3d06e0c818512cca53fb0881ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Collapse) (Plugin Parameters Collapse)",
      "contextHash": "7e5594f2ad7af33794caf6a359f3c6673471cc3d06e0c818512cca53fb0881ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＩＤ（Id）",
      "sourceHash": "b88ac6c47dd3d7053bbf3c23a44c77cfc7b080cbaee76487d956502b7f6179e2",
      "translation": "ID (Id) ",
      "contextHash": "b88ac6c47dd3d7053bbf3c23a44c77cfc7b080cbaee76487d956502b7f6179e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "管理用のＩＤです。",
      "sourceHash": "f8da081b225d19776797be64b0495e128f0d07382f97cef7520757c62924d068",
      "translation": "This is an ID for management purposes.",
      "contextHash": "f8da081b225d19776797be64b0495e128f0d07382f97cef7520757c62924d068"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "消滅タイプ（CollapseType）",
      "sourceHash": "5a5f459fa798f0224f16a97d6bd4e656294b45493ff841bf2e3d5b0a282c6ff1",
      "translation": "Collapse Type (CollapseType)",
      "contextHash": "5a5f459fa798f0224f16a97d6bd4e656294b45493ff841bf2e3d5b0a282c6ff1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅のタイプです。",
      "sourceHash": "7b75930a18a1e2a67a0edbf39e39e099caa08387ee5bebad07e273b1d1254353",
      "translation": "This is the collapse type.",
      "contextHash": "7b75930a18a1e2a67a0edbf39e39e099caa08387ee5bebad07e273b1d1254353"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『沈む』の場合は下に向かって消滅します。これはボスの消滅演出で使用している設定ですが、通常の雑魚敵にも使用できます。",
      "sourceHash": "6c5dd6eb3c4acf3bb9d9199a1cdf4584a278d88dbbc64d81464f350683e53dc4",
      "translation": "With 『Sink』, the enemy collapses downward. This setting is used for the boss collapse effect, but it can also be used for normal enemies.",
      "contextHash": "6c5dd6eb3c4acf3bb9d9199a1cdf4584a278d88dbbc64d81464f350683e53dc4"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "消滅時間（Duration）",
      "sourceHash": "718e5d4b4c69a68a3e759241466d2d62b09b1053861055220fa8de92bdd02323",
      "translation": "Collapse Duration (Duration)",
      "contextHash": "718e5d4b4c69a68a3e759241466d2d62b09b1053861055220fa8de92bdd02323"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅にかける時間です。",
      "sourceHash": "d7be982631deda9b794fdd9ab58101d8074e385c18802cecce335a8dac57ddf5",
      "translation": "The time it takes for the enemy to collapse.",
      "contextHash": "d7be982631deda9b794fdd9ab58101d8074e385c18802cecce335a8dac57ddf5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "this.bitmap.heightで画像の高さを参照できます。",
      "sourceHash": "133af45ce6e1eae5b7d40127ee2d407ebdac6012fe17c7ea69e649ed83474835",
      "translation": "You can reference the image height with this.bitmap.height.",
      "contextHash": "133af45ce6e1eae5b7d40127ee2d407ebdac6012fe17c7ea69e649ed83474835"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "これは標準のボスの消滅演出で使用されている値です。これによって、画像の高さに合わせた消滅演出を実行できます。",
      "sourceHash": "940fcd5f2edd752c28860be14353f53003b239c427cbccdd48a81829a7d0bf8c",
      "translation": "This is the value used for the default boss collapse effect. This allows a collapse effect adjusted to the image height to be executed.",
      "contextHash": "940fcd5f2edd752c28860be14353f53003b239c427cbccdd48a81829a7d0bf8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "合成方法（BlendMode）",
      "sourceHash": "67e93318c9dec5b057ee0d50c50d8b783adc96920537aff8fe86ea4e29e8edc9",
      "translation": "Blend Method (BlendMode)",
      "contextHash": "67e93318c9dec5b057ee0d50c50d8b783adc96920537aff8fe86ea4e29e8edc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅時の画像の合成方法です。",
      "sourceHash": "24c49265aeb535f3588dca192c319e9f80091c4c02fac3abe552f560d09e9fad",
      "translation": "The image blend method used when the enemy collapses.",
      "contextHash": "24c49265aeb535f3588dca192c319e9f80091c4c02fac3abe552f560d09e9fad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "色（BlendColor）",
      "sourceHash": "dd55af5a98fdd856e99d0ebd430e7115b48d27e0a1f134f40f2a8a9db81a8f9f",
      "translation": "Color (BlendColor)",
      "contextHash": "dd55af5a98fdd856e99d0ebd430e7115b48d27e0a1f134f40f2a8a9db81a8f9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅時の画像に適用する色です。",
      "sourceHash": "1c6d55328acbd16dd41ace09648dc0036166270b9ca722c6193763e4220b2dc3",
      "translation": "The color applied to the image when the enemy collapses.",
      "contextHash": "1c6d55328acbd16dd41ace09648dc0036166270b9ca722c6193763e4220b2dc3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例：[255,255,255,255]（赤、緑、青、強さ）",
      "sourceHash": "da12dfd773181e07e05ab3436b49f6ec4c2cb1e84de549829364bad1b2aae810",
      "translation": "Example: [255,255,255,255] (red, green, blue, strength)",
      "contextHash": "da12dfd773181e07e05ab3436b49f6ec4c2cb1e84de549829364bad1b2aae810"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "揺れの強さ（ShakeStrength）",
      "sourceHash": "03420a7afee7d73d529f45eb3bb9a08bec6b4fe72680e8df18dcdd732d4d6ee5",
      "translation": "Shake Strength (ShakeStrength)",
      "contextHash": "03420a7afee7d73d529f45eb3bb9a08bec6b4fe72680e8df18dcdd732d4d6ee5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "揺れの強さです。",
      "sourceHash": "b986b7dedd8753b72335391409d499a65d069dfc632866d9ca86b5635d8e62a8",
      "translation": "This is the shake strength.",
      "contextHash": "b986b7dedd8753b72335391409d499a65d069dfc632866d9ca86b5635d8e62a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-020",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "効果音１（開始）（Sound1）",
      "sourceHash": "975f53cdc330b0bd0006a74fa2f55c5139a90c443181a52a6d6fc78170dbe14c",
      "translation": "Sound Effect 1 (Start) (Sound1)",
      "contextHash": "975f53cdc330b0bd0006a74fa2f55c5139a90c443181a52a6d6fc78170dbe14c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-032",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅開始時の効果音です。",
      "sourceHash": "ddd4232e37c6ecd05040d3f025a10dea82d90bf7b0c73e509398f7f11e08c8a9",
      "translation": "This is the sound effect played when the disappearance begins.",
      "contextHash": "ddd4232e37c6ecd05040d3f025a10dea82d90bf7b0c73e509398f7f11e08c8a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-021",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "効果音２（繰返）（Sound2）",
      "sourceHash": "578b73e9677de924fbde5ecaf986d1791a7b204a2d06d981c2bc66789a929698",
      "translation": "Sound Effect 2 (Repeat) (Sound2)",
      "contextHash": "578b73e9677de924fbde5ecaf986d1791a7b204a2d06d981c2bc66789a929698"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-033",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅中に鳴らし続ける効果音です。",
      "sourceHash": "abf56b8863c00bcb3c1172cd0f19e95aec29e328199a13aa741a0f4b34e49e91",
      "translation": "This is the sound effect that continues playing during the disappearance.",
      "contextHash": "abf56b8863c00bcb3c1172cd0f19e95aec29e328199a13aa741a0f4b34e49e91"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-022",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "効果音２の間隔（Sound2Interval）",
      "sourceHash": "7205d1fcf3d5a3235ed677dc2facbc65ae0aee17a7ce1f65357ac6e12f007ace",
      "translation": "Sound Effect 2 Interval (Sound2Interval)",
      "contextHash": "7205d1fcf3d5a3235ed677dc2facbc65ae0aee17a7ce1f65357ac6e12f007ace"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-034",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "効果音２を繰り返し演奏する間隔です。",
      "sourceHash": "8d986c916b15c1f990accc06435e665b283b085cd16a6799689f71d449834ae1",
      "translation": "This is the interval at which Sound Effect 2 is played repeatedly.",
      "contextHash": "8d986c916b15c1f990accc06435e665b283b085cd16a6799689f71d449834ae1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-023",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "DynamicID（DynamicId）",
      "sourceHash": "d48a5049acc375618d042ec75b2d5160ba9473b31359a7f4ff238ad49c8e4540",
      "translation": "DynamicID (DynamicId) ",
      "contextHash": "d48a5049acc375618d042ec75b2d5160ba9473b31359a7f4ff238ad49c8e4540"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-035",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "DynamicAnimation&Motionによる消滅演出を指定します。",
      "sourceHash": "00fc88133ca33947660660363ba949a8a6832d801afe4c881291d28921740e48",
      "translation": "Specify the disappearance effect using DynamicAnimation&Motion.",
      "contextHash": "00fc88133ca33947660660363ba949a8a6832d801afe4c881291d28921740e48"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-036",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "スキルのＩＤを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "2b38ebb136adb3828b49053d6c6faefe2b71ab6febedaac7e006993422446b2a",
      "translation": "Please specify the skill ID.",
      "contextHash": "2b38ebb136adb3828b49053d6c6faefe2b71ab6febedaac7e006993422446b2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-024",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ウェイト（Wait）",
      "sourceHash": "bf9dae1c877a26e84a098a864bd38848c1f9aa482b8dd769742b5aa81f81a6aa",
      "translation": "Wait (Wait)",
      "contextHash": "bf9dae1c877a26e84a098a864bd38848c1f9aa482b8dd769742b5aa81f81a6aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-037",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅エフェクトを待つかどうかです。",
      "sourceHash": "b8a59208990ce6cf13e4e657c9d8b3eeba328bbbe453984e3e78f7af1609185c",
      "translation": "Whether to wait for the disappearance effect.",
      "contextHash": "b8a59208990ce6cf13e4e657c9d8b3eeba328bbbe453984e3e78f7af1609185c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-038",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄なら元の設定を引き継ぎます。",
      "sourceHash": "16f53f0beeb5bf297364c4f391ea31883abf0dca36e766428d8b3b4aa3a5398e",
      "translation": "If left blank, the original setting will be inherited.",
      "contextHash": "16f53f0beeb5bf297364c4f391ea31883abf0dca36e766428d8b3b4aa3a5398e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-039",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※空欄に戻す場合はＤＥＬキーで削除してください。",
      "sourceHash": "7dd6989a1ff97683038369fc88c04061e1982d1c4f449a529f105e9ca67d874e",
      "translation": "※To leave it blank again, delete it using the DEL key.",
      "contextHash": "7dd6989a1ff97683038369fc88c04061e1982d1c4f449a529f105e9ca67d874e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-025",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スクリプト（Script）",
      "sourceHash": "6c9f87dece54fc9e3b7d05daea689046806d4b618be399a6c1e23b9999cf45ac",
      "translation": "Script (Script)",
      "contextHash": "6c9f87dece54fc9e3b7d05daea689046806d4b618be399a6c1e23b9999cf45ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-040",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "消滅時に実行するスクリプトです。",
      "sourceHash": "9f5b44b0f3191364cf11adcc5b83d4caaf6e65248b19069c699ecb5ee92bdeda",
      "translation": "This is the script executed upon disappearance.",
      "contextHash": "9f5b44b0f3191364cf11adcc5b83d4caaf6e65248b19069c699ecb5ee92bdeda"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-041",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、以下は画面を振動させるスクリプトです。",
      "sourceHash": "be197bcfe4b73b80a91058eb3e0dd84c795aa518387c2abef8594c858092b708",
      "translation": "For example, the following script shakes the screen.",
      "contextHash": "be197bcfe4b73b80a91058eb3e0dd84c795aa518387c2abef8594c858092b708"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-042",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "揺れの強さ=1, 揺れの速さ=20, 揺れの時間=this.bitmap.height（画像の高さ）",
      "sourceHash": "7ff51fe7b4456746dbf9a76c7c7a36d646cb6de81ddcd4b83975bb564fa824db",
      "translation": "Shake strength=1, shake speed=20, shake duration=this.bitmap.height (image height)",
      "contextHash": "7ff51fe7b4456746dbf9a76c7c7a36d646cb6de81ddcd4b83975bb564fa824db"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-043",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "という意味になります。",
      "sourceHash": "669e5717c54e935514df94404d5ed8d5b9ee32707015aed4e00a8422a39f8dbb",
      "translation": "This is what it means.",
      "contextHash": "669e5717c54e935514df94404d5ed8d5b9ee32707015aed4e00a8422a39f8dbb"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "さらに、[[LINK_1]]DynamicAnimation&Motion[[/LINK_1]]の呼び出しによって、煙のようなアニメーションを再生しています。",
      "sourceHash": "ace81d63f64dc71e465f8b241435ee8d2def7371e56773f8fcf33a3639580952",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "さらに、",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "DynamicAnimation&Motion",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "の呼び出しによって、煙のようなアニメーションを再生しています。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Additionally, a smoke-like animation is played by calling [[LINK_1]]DynamicAnimation&Motion[[/LINK_1]].",
      "contextHash": "ace81d63f64dc71e465f8b241435ee8d2def7371e56773f8fcf33a3639580952"
    },
